    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "inake, madhao palrapalra takaava’imite dha’aneta.",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924609",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ta’acakelanaeni taakae mene, ’atoloro madhao ocao takaava’i.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924610",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "maraveraverelrao, mo’adhailingalrailine kicengecengele.",
                "textCh": "我好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924611",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "apakacere, cekelaemita marikoco ’ina mene, amokaamaimo’o pasopalra.",
                "textCh": "確實！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924612",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ia’e, amopataoaelrao.",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會去！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924613",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "amooanalrao solrahele naoto’araki aiaeta takiae.",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924614",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "naokaamaimia’e pasopalra.",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924615",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "ia’e, lolodhiae!",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66269/924616",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
